<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Western Atlas rating cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Western Atlas rating cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jefferies &amp; Co Inc said its analyst Byron Dunn cut his rating on shares of Western Atlas Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
